  "info": {
    "title": "Get FBT MCF Order Status",
    "version": "202601",
    "description": "This API allows you to query the status of **MCF Orders**. When an order has not been shipped, the `consign_orders` field will contain no data; once the order has been shipped, the `consign_orders` field will display the consignment details of the order. If a single package cannot accommodate the entire order (due to carrier restrictions or packaging size limitations), the **FBT** system will split the order into multiple packages for fulfillment, in which case the `consign_orders` field will contain multiple entries corresponding to the respective packages."
  },
